{"name":"11-3-2E","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"},{"type":"background","value":"167","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Boss","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Bang bang!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dammit, they've scattered our forces! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Mk46, is your team doing alright?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Mk46","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"通讯框":""}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mk46","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We can hold out just fine, but the enemies are heading your way!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Mk46","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We'll think of something! Let's split up for now! Don't let them surround you!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Mk46","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Mk46","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But...we can't just leave you behind!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Mk46","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're elite T-Dolls, and with two of us, they're gonna have a hard time trying to capture us. Worry about yo